{"s":98,"v":[{"t":"Those who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture and the polytheists were not to be parted [from misbelief] until there came to them clear evidence","w":[["لَمْ","Not","lam",""],["يَكُنِ","were","yakuni",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["أَهْلِ","(the) People","ahli",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","of the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","and the polytheists","wal-mush'rikīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["مُشْرِكِينَ",277]]],["مُنفَكِّينَ","to be abandoned","munfakkīna",""],["حَتَّىٰ","until","ḥattā",""],["تَأْتِيَهُمُ","(there) comes to them","tatiyahumu","",[["تَأْتِيَ",62],["هُمُ",3]]],["ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","the clear evidence","l-bayinatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["بَيِّنَةُ",182]]]]},{"t":"A Messenger from Allāh, reciting purified scriptures","w":[["رَسُولٌۭ","A Messenger","rasūlun",""],["مِّنَ","from","mina",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["يَتْلُوا۟","reciting","yatlū",""],["صُحُفًۭا","pages","ṣuḥufan",""],["مُّطَهَّرَةًۭ","purified","muṭahharatan",""]]},{"t":"Within which are correct writings [i.e., rulings and laws].","w":[["فِيهَا","Wherein","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["كُتُبٌۭ","(are) writings","kutubun",""],["قَيِّمَةٌۭ","correct","qayyimatun",""]]},{"t":"Nor did those who were given the Scripture become divided until after there had come to them clear evidence.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["تَفَرَّقَ","became divided","tafarraqa",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["أُوتُوا۟","were given","ūtū","",[["أُوتُ",59],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","the Book","l-kitāba","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبَ",63]]],["إِلَّا","until","illā",""],["مِنۢ","from","min",""],["بَعْدِ","after","baʿdi",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["جَآءَتْهُمُ","came (to) them","jāathumu","",[["جَآءَتْ",57],["هُمُ",3]]],["ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","(of) the clear evidence","l-bayinatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["بَيِّنَةُ",182]]]]},{"t":"And they were not commanded except to worship Allāh, [being] sincere to Him in religion, inclining to truth, and to establish prayer and to give zakāh. And that is the correct religion.","w":[["وَمَآ","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أُمِرُوٓا۟","they were commanded","umirū","",[["أُمِرُ",161],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["لِيَعْبُدُوا۟","to worship","liyaʿbudū","",[["لِ",8],["يَعْبُدُ",115],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["مُخْلِصِينَ","(being) sincere","mukh'liṣīna",""],["لَهُ","to Him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُ",5]]],["ٱلدِّينَ","(in) the religion","l-dīna","",[["ٱل",2],["دِّينَ",136]]],["حُنَفَآءَ","upright","ḥunafāa",""],["وَيُقِيمُوا۟","and to establish","wayuqīmū","",[["وَ",1],["يُقِيمُ",228],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","the prayer","l-ṣalata","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّلَوٰةَ",152]]],["وَيُؤْتُوا۟","and to give","wayu'tū","",[["وَ",1],["يُؤْتُ",59],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","the zakah","l-zakata","ۚ",[["ٱل",2],["زَّكَوٰةَ",363]]],["وَذَٰلِكَ","And that","wadhālika","",[["وَ",1],["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["دِينُ","(is the) religion","dīnu",""],["ٱلْقَيِّمَةِ","the correct","l-qayimati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَيِّمَةِ",2566]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, they who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture and the polytheists will be in the fire of Hell, abiding eternally therein. Those are the worst of creatures.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieve","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["أَهْلِ","(the) People","ahli",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","and the polytheists","wal-mush'rikīna","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["مُشْرِكِينَ",277]]],["فِى","(will be) in","fī",""],["نَارِ","(the) Fire","nāri",""],["جَهَنَّمَ","(of) Hell","jahannama",""],["خَـٰلِدِينَ","abiding eternally","khālidīna",""],["فِيهَآ","therein","fīhā","ۚ",[["فِي",14],["هَآ",22]]],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","Those ","ulāika","",[["أُو